<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Transamerica started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Transamerica started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan said on Tuesday it started coverage of diversified financial services company Transamerica Corp with a market perform rating and a 12-month price target of $107 per share.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Michelle Giordano said in a research note that market conditions in several of its businesses were &quot;less than optimal&quot; because of competition, absence of significant demand and an unfavorable interest rate environment.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We see near-term earnings uncertainty caused by the start-up nature of its centralized consumer finance operations and weak leasing market conditions,&quot; she said.</p>
<p>-- But Giordano said share buybacks were likely to mitigate downside risk for the stock short-term.</p>
<p>-- Transamerica stock lost 3/16 to 98-5/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
